  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a unique nautical welcome, featuring a custom anchor design that can be adorned with your boat name or location. It serves as a distinctive decorative accent for marine environments. Crafted for both indoor and outdoor use, this mat blends aesthetic appeal with functional durability, making it ideal for enhancing any waterside entrance.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat or family name for a unique welcome.</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs.</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads to keep the mat securely in place.</li>\n<li>Designed for easy cleaning; simply shake, vacuum, or wipe.</li>\n<li>Suitable for high-traffic areas on boats, marinas, and coastal homes.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe clean with a damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This nautical doormat is perfect for adding a personalized touch to cabins, ships, yachts, fishing boats, and dockside areas. It's also suitable for marina entries and coastal homes, enhancing any space with a seafaring theme.</p>",
